[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington-action/releases/409583857","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington-action/releases/409583857/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington-action/releases/409583857/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington-action/releases/tag/v1.7.2","id":409583857,"author":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"RE_kwDOUC-tfs4YacDx","tag_name":"v1.7.2","target_commitish":"main","name":"v1.7.2: Fix isolated objects-cache cleanup with mbx 1.22 and add clean-target-before-export","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2026-10-11T10:01:53Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T10:02:39Z","published_at":"2026-10-11T10:02:08Z","assets":[],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington-action/tarball/v1.7.2","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jdx/mr-boxington-action/zipball/v1.7.2","body":"Cleanup of the isolated objects cache now works with the read-only object trees that mbx 1.22 creates. A new opt-in input, `clean-target-before-export`, frees runner disk space before the bundle is exported. Both changes apply only with `isolate-objects-cache: true`.\n\n## Added\n- **`clean-target-before-export` input** (#68, @donbeave). Defaults to `false`. When set, the post step runs `mbx clean` for the configured workspace just before it exports the isolated objects bundle. This removes the workspace's managed Cargo target and learned incremental state, so the target and the staged bundle are not both on disk at the same time. The mbx action results and objects stay in the isolated store and are exported as usual.\n\n  ```yaml\n  - uses: jdx/mr-boxington-action@v1\n    with:\n      github-cache-mode: objects\n      isolate-objects-cache: true\n      clean-target-before-export: true\n  ```\n\n  The input requires `isolate-objects-cache: true`, and setup fails without it. Cleanup runs only when the action is going to save after a cache miss. Restore-only runs and exact cache hits skip it. If cleanup fails, the action doesn't export the bundle. Enable this input only when no later step in the job needs the target tree. The disk-usage diagnostics also record a sample after cleanup and before export.\n\n## Fixed\n- **Removing isolated objects-cache directories with mbx 1.22** (#62, @donbeave). mbx 1.22 creates object-cache `OUT_DIR` trees that are read-only. Because of this, the action could not delete the isolated store or bundle after a successful import or during post-step cleanup. The action now restores owner write access across its own tree before deleting it. On Windows, it also clears the read-only flag on files. Symlinks inside the tree are not followed, so their targets outside the tree are left unchanged.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/jdx/mr-boxington-action/compare/v1.7.1...v1.7.2","mentions_count":1}]